WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
How to complete the Hambare survey project brief

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:12.000
The form is divided into three short stages.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Choose the closest service, then enter the project location, stage and approximate size.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Add the expected output, available records, preferred timing and site-access information.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Explain what the survey will support, then provide your name and WhatsApp number.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Prepare the brief and review the generated message before sending.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:05.000
Open WhatsApp and attach plans, title documents, drawings or site photographs.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:11.000
Hambare Geosurveys — survey data that moves projects forward.
